# {{PROJECT_NAME}} — Patterns

How the pieces go together. The component pages say what each piece is for; **none of them says how
several of them compose into the thing a consumer is actually building**, and that gap is what this
document closes.

A pattern is a recipe: a recurring problem, the components it is solved with, and the decisions
already made so nobody re-makes them. It is not a new component, and writing one down does not
create one.

Owned by whoever owns the components. A pattern earns its place by having been built more than once.

